{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05197","headline":"让帝挽歌词二首 一 · 卢僎","name":"让帝挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泰伯玄风远，延州德让行。\n阖棺追大节，树羽册鸿名。\n地户迎天仗，皇阶失帝兄。\n还闻汉明主，遗劒泣东平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}